WEBVTT

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.810
I do not know!

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:08.020
No way! I'm sure Sword will show up today!

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.110
No matter how many times
you stop in, I do not know!

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:15.610
Fine! I'll search for him myself!

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:20.120
Dear customer! Our new menu items...

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:24.120
The avocado cheddar sandwich,
hot and sweet hash browns,

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:28.000
and the three-fruit smoothie
with a double tower of toppings

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:30.960
are what we recommend today!

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:44.570
Unfortunately, we must turn away
anyone who has no method to pay!

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:10.960
<i>The monochromatic empty eyes</i>
<i>of</i> <i>sapiens</i> <i>floating</i> <i>within the unreality</i>

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:16.340
<i>Completely peerless flowing</i> <i>blood,</i>
<i>controlled</i> <i>and digitized</i>

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:18.010
<i>Just dark world (BOOM)</i>

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:19.430
<i>Glitter world (NO DOUBT)</i>

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:20.600
<i>Can you see?</i>

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:22.770
<i>(BOOING BOOING) Hellacious</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.140
<i>Just dark world (BOOM)</i>

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:25.810
<i>Glitter world (NO DOUBT)</i>

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:26.850
<i>I can see!</i>

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:28.850
<i>The timing of the programming</i>

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:29.730
<i>Yea, gotcha!</i>

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:33.440
<i>I want to be eroded away (brain wash)</i>

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:35.610
<i>Up the blast! </i>

00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:39.660
<i>Ah, this dying world </i>

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:46.160
<i>Run like you're piercing through it</i>

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:52.500
<i>The rising flames burn everything away </i>

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:57.170
<i>Your resolve and your love</i>

00:01:57.170 --> 00:02:00.760
<i>From darkness to the light</i>

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:22.910
I'm begging you!

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:24.160
Absolutely not!

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:29.750
I already gave you
your allowance for the month.

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:31.750
I will not allow unnecessary luxuries!

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.790
It's not a luxury!

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:36.920
Going to a restaurant when you
already get meals from the institution,

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:39.810
is what I call a luxury!

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:48.050
Do you hate your life here?

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:53.380
I'm sure you're doing this for Martin,

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:56.780
but why not just leave
things to the police?

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:03.200
The police don't know
anything about El Dorado.

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:04.370
Huh?

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:08.620
Nothing.

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:20.630
What are you doing, Sophie?

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:23.520
Nothing much.

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:28.060
Hey, did you finish your presentation
essay for the next meeting?

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:29.540
The due date is close!

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:39.400
Did anyone witness this event?

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:41.110
Don't know.

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:43.200
What, did you get ripped off or something?

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.950
No, I'm looking into a rumor.

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:46.990
What rumor?

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:49.370
The rumor about a guy in golden armor

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:53.210
that shows up at the scene
of missing people cases?

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:55.500
What are you talking about?

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:57.920
I've never heard of such a rumor, have you?

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:00.800
He calls himself a Makai Knight.

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:02.930
He's a mental case!

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:05.020
You should ask on an
occult thread, not here!

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:07.300
Then, what about other cases...

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:08.890
Hey! Sophie!

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:13.270
Did you hear my warning?

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:17.570
The essay is due the day after tomorrow!

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:20.820
If you don't get it done this time,
Sister will definitely blow a fuse.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:24.280
Oh. Was that due the day after tomorrow?

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:29.280
By the way, remember Father Ripley,
who came to Mass that one time?

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:30.660
The super nice one.

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:33.080
I don't really remember.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:35.250
I heard he went missing!

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:36.460
Missing?

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:38.920
I was so surprised when I heard
about it in the cafeteria yesterday!

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:40.750
They say that you can hear

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:45.180
a strange voice coming
from his house each night...

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:48.640
How scary is that?! I can't
sleep alone at night anymore!

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:50.180
What do they mean
by strange voices, anyways?!

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:55.680
I'm coming in.

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:00.070
Where is Sophie?

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:04.070
She's right...

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:04.840
Huh?

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:13.250
That girl again!

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:25.320
If this case is related to Horrors
like the Moon Wizard case,

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:28.640
I might be able to meet Sword!

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:40.690
It's a little bit past this street.

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:45.990
Father Ripley fixed up an old church
and lived together with Miss Marie.

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:47.480
Miss Marie?

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:50.120
She's Father Ripley's little sister.

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:52.830
She was a real beauty when she was young.

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:57.960
She's sickly and rarely shows
her face to anyone nowadays.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:02.840
Her brother was a stout believer
and a wonderful priest.

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:10.720
Over here, Brother!

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:12.010
Hey! Watch out!

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:17.310
S-Sorry.

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:24.360
Martin! What's this?

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:26.860
I bought it with the reward money
I got from programming.

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:28.540
Chocolate...

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:30.950
You can eat it all!

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:32.390
Thanks!

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:43.500
Sophie. Someday, I'll let you eat
your fill of the things you love!

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:06.960
E-Excuse me!

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:08.710
Who is it?

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:12.840
Sorry for intruding so suddenly.

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:18.180
My name is Sophia Hennes.

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:20.870
I'm from Catherine Home in Russell City.

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:23.410
Father Ripley took care of us before.

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:26.420
Um, are you Miss Marie?

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:30.880
Yes, I am. Nice to meet you.

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:35.350
Um! I was wondering
if I could chat with you a bit!

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:38.720
Please come on in.

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:40.600
Y-Yes!

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:47.650
And your brother has
been missing since then?

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:51.640
Yes. That's why it
still hasn't sunk in at all.

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:53.540
What about the police?

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:59.610
They listened, but it seems
there are a lot of cases like this.

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:02.710
They told me not to be too hopeful.

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:04.140
That's terrible.

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:10.460
The police don't understand
how we feel, living each day like this!

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:12.550
<i>We</i>?

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:16.950
I've been looking for my
big brother this whole time, too.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:21.010
My. You also have a brother, Sophie?

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:24.540
I see.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:29.020
Miss Marie. You haven't
been eating properly, right?

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:29.830
Huh?

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:39.180
How is it?

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:40.540
Thank you.

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:43.790
It's delicious!

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:45.180
Thank goodness!

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:48.240
The taste will really deepen
if we let it simmer a bit more!

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:50.420
Miss Marie.

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:54.300
Did you make all these
dried flowers yourself?

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.550
That's right.

00:08:55.550 --> 00:09:01.220
I pick fresh flowers and
dry them like this in the room.

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:05.270
Since I'm always in the house,
it just turned into a hobby of mine.

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:08.800
Wow. There's so many!

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:12.650
Oh! Is that you in the picture, Miss Marie?

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:15.150
Yes, it's quite old.

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:18.160
It was when I went to the town festival.

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:20.450
So pretty!

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:22.570
Don't look so closely at it.

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:26.580
Why not?! You're so pretty, even now.

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:31.590
I bet if you wore a dress and
went out you'd be super popular!

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:35.670
Nonsense. I'm no longer...

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:40.390
I'll get it.

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:44.150
Yes!

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:47.690
Huh?

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:50.580
Sword?!

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:07.040
Why are you here?

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:09.290
Not "you"! Sophie!

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:11.090
You better remember!

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:14.210
I was looking for you this whole time!

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:15.420
What?

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:16.820
Well, whatever!

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:19.090
What are you doing here today?

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:21.760
Did you come to look
into Father Ripley's case?

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:22.640
Huh?

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:28.190
Huh? Wait. Aren't you here
to see if Horrors are involved?

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:29.860
What are you talking about?

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:34.780
Today, I came here to meet
Father Ripley's little sister!

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:35.610
Huh?

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:37.110
Miss Marie?

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:38.610
Sophie?

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:39.910
Miss Marie!

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:41.700
Is he a friend of yours, Sophie?

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:43.050
Oh. Um...

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:46.830
Oh! So you're Miss Marie! Move over, kid.

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:47.850
H-Hey!

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:52.580
Nice to meet you! My name is Sword.

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:56.380
I'm sure you're going through a
difficult time because of your brother.

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:01.300
Please lean on me whenever you'd like!

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:05.430
I know things can get tough
for a single woman living alone.

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:09.600
I hope I can help
you out whenever needed!

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:11.560
Will you accept these?

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:15.540
Y-Yes.

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:16.970
Thanks.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:18.600
Well, then!

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:22.030
Um!

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:28.300
I've only come to say hello today.

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:31.190
Delinquents should
go home before it gets dark!

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:32.790
Y-Yeah.

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:34.410
Okay.

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:44.010
Wait! What am I doing?!

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:46.680
Miss Marie, I'll be right back!

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:09.750
Marie.

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:22.090
I said, wait!

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:26.100
Hey! What's El Dorado?! Tell me!

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:31.220
You're real persistent.

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:34.040
You know...

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:35.830
Oh, Miss Marie!

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:36.730
Huh?

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:41.840
Hey!

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:46.600
See ya!

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:57.480
She's quite the lively little girl.

00:12:57.920 --> 00:13:00.710
Damn, she's messing up my plans!

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:03.010
Looks like you'll have to speed things up.

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:04.750
I know.

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:15.200
I'm back.

00:13:16.150 --> 00:13:19.980
I'm sorry I took so long, Miss Marie.

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:21.810
Welcome back, Sophie.

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:23.530
Were you able to
speak with him properly?

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:25.280
No.

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:27.330
But I'll definitely see him again!

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:30.310
Those flowers...

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:34.200
Yes, I thought I'd
decorate the house with it.

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:37.500
Also, would you like
to have dinner with me?

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:39.960
Looks like you're
feeling better, Miss Marie!

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:43.170
Yes. Thanks to you, Sophie!

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:49.600
That was delicious!

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:52.040
Can I have a second helping?

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:54.770
You must have been quite hungry.

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:58.600
Well, I'll get sleepy if I eat too much.

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:01.230
Would you like to stay the night?

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:06.880
Oh, I'm sorry. You have
to go back to the facility.

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:08.130
But...

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:10.910
You should go home after you finish this.

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:17.420
I always ate with my brother
about this time of day.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:22.220
After he finished eating,
he would take a shower

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:26.080
and fall asleep up in his
bedroom while reading a book.

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:29.090
I would always turn off the lights for him.

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:32.700
It's strange to spend
my evenings alone like this.

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:35.100
It was the same for me.

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:39.270
When I was a little kid,
I really hated the night.

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:41.230
The night?

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:45.840
But my big brother
would always be by my side.

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:54.490
You don't like the night?

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:56.880
It's quiet and dark.

00:14:57.960 --> 00:15:01.210
It makes me feel so alone.

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:04.550
I see. Wait a sec.

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:08.630
Look! A bear!

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:12.790
It's so cute!

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:20.720
I'm with you, Sophie.
That's why you'll be fine!

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:26.900
Your brother was a very kind person.

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:31.110
Yeah. We were always together.

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:34.450
He taught me about computers
and everything else.

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:35.280
I see.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.830
Wasn't Father Ripley kind, too?

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:41.580
Of course he was.

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:45.840
He loved me more than anyone else.

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:47.090
Yeah!

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:50.650
And my brother always used to tell me...

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:54.150
...that I was a really
beautiful little sister.

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:57.930
You must've been a little sister
he was really proud of.

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:01.810
That's why he told me
not to leave the house!

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.270
That I should never wear a dress again!

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:08.480
That I shouldn't speak with any men!

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:13.450
Huh? Miss Marie. Th-That hurts!

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:49.110
Stop!

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:51.320
Miss Marie! Let me go!

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:57.120
I-I'm sorry. I-I...

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:00.030
It was all my brother's fault.

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:04.310
Because of him.

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:07.590
Because of him, I...

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:10.110
M-Miss Marie?!

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:14.270
You don't understand
because you're still young.

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:16.460
You know, I...

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:18.640
D-Don't come any closer!

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:22.220
I'm going to die without
being able to do a single thing!

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:23.730
No!

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:32.020
It was all his fault.

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:34.380
It was all your fault.

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:39.590
It was all your fault!

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:52.650
Let me eat your future!

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:54.610
N-Noo!

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:02.540
S-Sword!

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:07.910
Dammit. This is because
you ignored my warning!

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:12.210
The missing priest was
eaten up by this thing!

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:18.170
Stay here!

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:45.550
Me, too!

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:52.270
So reckless.

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:04.450
Wait!

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:11.870
I have to know what El Dorado is!

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:16.460
Why are you so obsessed about that?

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:22.220
My brother's disappearance
might have been caused by a Horror.

00:21:27.850 --> 00:21:29.100
El Dorado?

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:38.810
If my brother's disappearance has
to do with Horrors and El Dorado,

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:40.890
I need your help!

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:44.360
Please help me find my brother!

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:55.870
What's your big brother's name?

00:21:58.880 --> 00:21:59.730
Martin.

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:02.090
Martin Hennes.

00:22:07.430 --> 00:22:08.380
First...

00:22:10.550 --> 00:22:12.430
How about we get some tacos?

00:22:18.230 --> 00:22:18.980
Yeah!

00:22:31.030 --> 00:22:41.090
<i>When I close my eyes I feel</i>
<i>gentle</i> <i>arms</i> <i>around</i> <i>me</i>

00:22:41.090 --> 00:22:45.550
<i>Warmth and memory</i>

00:22:45.550 --> 00:22:49.930
<i>SIGHT I can feel it now</i>

00:22:49.930 --> 00:22:54.220
<i>Without even saying goodbye</i>

00:22:54.220 --> 00:23:02.820
<i>We've chosen different</i> <i>paths</i>
<i>without</i> <i>realizing</i> <i>it</i>

00:23:02.820 --> 00:23:10.450
<i>Forced forward at the mercy of fate</i>

00:23:10.450 --> 00:23:12.370
<i>When I'm sad</i>

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:28.300
<i>I keep thinking of your</i>
<i>sweet</i> <i>smile</i> <i>as</i> <i>I</i> <i>look</i> <i>up</i> <i>at the sky</i>

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:32.850
<i>I want to protect you</i>

00:23:32.850 --> 00:23:41.060
<i>I will become strong and keep walking </i>

00:23:41.060 --> 00:23:48.280
<i>That's how I will live for another</i>
